                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: We fine-tune a pretrained                           
                    DenseNet‐121 on our binary malignant vs                     
                    benign task using 3‐fold stratified                         
                    cross‐validation with random horizontal                     
                    flips and rotations, resizing all                           
                    images to 224×224. Each fold is trained                     
                    for 3 epochs with Adam and a cosine                         
                    annealing scheduler, using                                  
                    BCEWithLogitsLoss, and we compute ROC                       
                    AUC on each validation split. We then                       
                    retrain the model on the full dataset                       
