                    Design: We fine-tune a pretrained                           
                    MobileNetV2 to classify malignant vs                        
                    non-malignant lesions, freezing the                         
                    backbone and retraining the classifier                      
                    head. We split the dataset 80/20 with                       
                    stratification, apply standard                              
