                    Results: The model training and                             
                    evaluation completed successfully                           
                    without any bugs. The 3-fold                                
                    cross-validation on the skin lesion                         
                    dataset yielded a strong mean ROC AUC                       
                    of 0.9235 with low variance, indicating                     
                    good and stable model performance. The                      
                    final model was retrained on the full                       
                    dataset and saved for inference. The                        
