                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: We will integrate a ColorJitter                     
                    augmentation into the training                              
                    pipeline, adding random brightness,                         
                    contrast, saturation, and hue                               
                    variations to the existing horizontal                       
                    flips and rotations. This should                            
                    improve model robustness to diverse                         
                    skin tone and lighting conditions. We                       
                    will keep the DenseNet-161 backbone,                        
                    3-fold stratified cross-validation, and                     
                    horizontal-flip TTA unchanged, then                         
                    retrain on the full dataset with the                        
                    new augmentation and save the model.                        
                    The predict() function remains the                          
                    same.                                                       
